    <Questions>
      <Question Group="Symptoms" Text="Can you tell me what you are feeling right now?">
        <Answer>Everything hurts and I feel dizzy.</Answer><Answer>I cannot catch my breath.</Answer>
      </Question>
      <Question Group="Medical History" Text="Are you taking any prescribed medications?">
        <Answer>Just some standard blood thinners.</Answer><Answer>I take nitroglycerin, but I lost my bottle.</Answer><Answer>I have not been able to afford my medication lately.</Answer>
      </Question>
      <Question Group="Personal Information" Text="Can you tell me your name?">
        <Answer>My name is Alex Johnson.</Answer><Answer>It is Alex. Alex Johnson.</Answer>
      </Question>
      <Question Group="Pain Assessment" Text="On a scale of 1 to 10, how bad is the pain?">
        <Answer>It is about a four.</Answer><Answer>It is an eight, maybe a nine.</Answer><Answer>It is a ten. I am in agony.</Answer>
      </Question>
      <Question Group="Allergies and Intake" Text="Are you allergic to any medications?">
        <Answer>Yes, I have a severe penicillin allergy.</Answer><Answer>I do not think so.</Answer>
      </Question>
      <Question Group="Neurological" Text="Do you remember what happened to you?">
        <Answer>I was walking and suddenly collapsed.</Answer><Answer>One minute I was driving, then nothing.</Answer>
      </Question>
      <Question Group="Trauma" Text="Did you lose consciousness at any point?">
        <Answer>No, I have been awake the whole time.</Answer><Answer>I think so. I woke up on the ground.</Answer>
      </Question>
      <Question Group="Intoxication" Text="Have you had alcohol or recreational drugs today?">
        <Answer>No, absolutely not.</Answer><Answer>I took something, but I do not know what it was.</Answer>
      </Question>
    </Questions>
